@startuml
title Firebase Auth, Firestore Task Creation, and Priority Feed
hide footbox
skinparam shadowing false

actor Student
boundary "Signal browser UI" as UI
control "Firebase Web SDK" as WebSDK
database "Firebase Authentication" as Auth
control "Next.js Server Actions" as Actions
control "App auth / session service" as Session
control "Firestore repositories" as Repo
database "Firestore (cloud or emulator)" as Firestore

note over WebSDK,Firestore
  FIREBASE_MODE selects one backend for the whole process:
  emulator mode uses loopback Auth/Firestore; cloud mode requires
  a dedicated development project and server service-account credentials.
  Firestore Rules deny browser reads/writes. Server repositories use
  Admin SDK and enforce ownership themselves.
end note

== Sign up and establish application session ==
Student -> UI: Enter email, password, name, username
UI -> WebSDK: createUserWithEmailAndPassword(email, password)
WebSDK -> Auth: Create Firebase Auth identity
Auth --> WebSDK: User credential
WebSDK --> UI: ID token
UI -> Actions: signupAction(idToken, profile fields)
Actions -> Session: verify ID token and profile input
Session -> Auth: verifyIdToken(idToken)
Auth --> Session: Firebase UID and verified claims
Session -> Firestore: Transactionally write UserProfile,\nUsernameReservation, AuthProfileMap
Firestore --> Session: Commit or error
Session -> Auth: createSessionCookie(idToken)
Auth --> Session: HTTP-only session cookie
Session --> Actions: AppUser and session cookie
Actions --> UI: Serializable success or error

== Add a task and reload the priority feed ==
Student -> UI: Enter task and optionally choose a course
UI -> Actions: createTaskAction(parsed task, courseId?)
Actions -> Session: requireAppUser()
Session -> Auth: verifySessionCookie(cookie, checkRevoked=true)
Auth --> Session: Firebase UID
Session -> Firestore: Resolve AuthProfileMap and UserProfile
Firestore --> Session: Owner profile
Session --> Actions: AppUser or unauthenticated

alt no authenticated app user
  Actions --> UI: Sign-in error
else authenticated
  Actions -> Actions: Allowlist/validate task fields and normalize dates
  alt invalid task input
    Actions --> UI: Validation error; no database write
  else valid input
    Actions -> Repo: createUserTask(ownerId, typed input)
    opt courseId supplied
      Repo -> Firestore: Read course document
      Firestore --> Repo: Course ownerId and fields
      Repo -> Repo: Require course.ownerId == ownerId
    end
    Repo -> Repo: Calculate score; omit absent optional fields;\nconstruct FirestoreTaskDocument
    Repo -> Firestore: Write tasks/{taskId}
    Firestore --> Repo: Commit or error
    alt write succeeded
      Repo --> Actions: Created task ID
      Actions --> UI: Serializable success result
      UI -> UI: router.refresh()
      UI -> Actions: Request refreshed home page
      Actions -> Session: requireAppUser()
      Session --> Actions: Verified AppUser
      Actions -> Repo: listUserTasks(ownerId), listUserCourses(ownerId),\nlistUserEvents(ownerId)
      Repo -> Firestore: Owner-scoped queries using committed indexes
      Firestore --> Repo: Task, course, and event documents
      Repo --> Actions: Typed view data
      Actions --> UI: Render sorted Priority Feed
      UI --> Student: Show new task with score and course label
    else write rejected
      Firestore --> Repo: Firestore error
      Repo --> Actions: Error
      Actions --> UI: Save error; no success refresh
    end
  end
end
@enduml
